start

:Choose "Info Provider";
:Info Provider tree is displayed;
:The Info Area is displayed;

note right 
It contains Info Provider characteristics and is used to group further objects
end note

:Open context menu;
:Choose "Create Info Cube";

fork 
:Enter "ZD_SALES" as the technical name;
fork again 
:Enter "Sales Overview" as the description;
end fork

:Select "Standard Info Cube" as Info Provider Type;
:Choose "Create";
:Screen for Info Cube editing is shown;

:Open context menu;
:Choose "Create New Dimensions";
:Enter "Product" as the new dimension description;
:Choose "Create Another Dimension";

:Enter "Sales Organization" as the next dimension description;
:Choose "Continue";
:Dimensions are inserted;

:Open the toolbar on the left;
:Choose "Info Object Catalog";
:Select your Info Object catalog for characteristics;
:Choose "Continue";
:Info Object catalog is displayed;

:Open context menu;
:Choose "Info Object Direct Input";
:Enter characteristic 0DOC_NUMBER;

note right 
Sales Document:a shipped Info Object of BI Content
end note

:Choose "Continue";

:Expand "Navigation Attributes" folder;
:Set the indicator ON/OFF;
:Activate navigation attribute;
note right:ZD_PROD__ZDPGROUP

stop
